      "text": "```\nDEFINITION: A (two-sided) ideal I ⊆ R satisfies:\n  I is an additive subgroup of R.\n  For all r ∈ R, a ∈ I: ra ∈ I and ar ∈ I.  (absorbing condition)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-RINGS-IDEALS.md#018",
      "path": [
        "04-RINGS-IDEALS.md"
      ],
