        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Rings and Ideals",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Left ideal: only ra ∈ I required.\nRight ideal: only ar ∈ I required.\nFor commutative rings: all three notions coincide."
    },
    {
