      "text": "SMALLEST IDEAL CONTAINING S:\n  (S) = ⟨S⟩ = intersection of all ideals containing S\n       = {Σ rᵢ aᵢ : rᵢ ∈ R, aᵢ ∈ S, finite sum}"
