      "text": "MAXIMAL IDEAL: M ⊆ R such that no ideal properly between M and R.\n  Equivalent: R/M is a field.\n  Every maximal ideal is prime.\n  In Z: prime ideals = (p) for primes p, plus (0).\n        maximal ideals = (p) for primes p."
